/// M02 CORE-041 "bundled templates: main/helpers roots green, quiet
/// assert".
/// Source: tests/integration/templates_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledTemplates.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/templates/main.can,
/// helpers.can (ground for every root pin below: targets 4, helpers 4,
/// consumers 4, main 1 = 13 roots).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 13 roots grounded per row kind in main.can+helpers.can, the three
/// report evidence labels, and zero live requests during assertions.
/// The silent production run, fixture erasure and strict emission live in
/// core-041-production-shape.can; the wrong-exact-target build rejection
/// lives in core-041-wrong-target.can.
/// Variants: main/helpers fixture set.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/templates-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-set, target-roots, helper-roots, consumer-roots,
/// main-roots, label-supplied, label-raw, label-real, assert-quiet.
/// Facet map (templates_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L106-109: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L110-113: passed true, 13 assertions); fixture-set grounds the 13
/// roots in main.can+helpers.can; target-roots pins targets (main.can L11:
/// double 2 => ok 4, L18: triple 2 => ok 6, L25: identity 3 => ok 3, L44:
/// load => ok receipt(7)); helper-roots pins helpers (L59: 9 => ok 18,
/// L77: 9 => ok 27, L95: 9 => ok 9, L111: => ok receipt(1));
/// consumer-roots pins consumers (L68: => ok 10, L86: => ok 15, L104:
/// => ok 7, L121: => ok receipt(7)); main-roots pins main (L132: [] =>
/// ok); label-supplied/label-raw/label-real pin the report labels (L114-118:
/// supplied-completion, raw-provider-fixture, real-can); assert-quiet pins
/// the no-live-request facet (L119-123: loads 0 during assert).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
